nec260:   Linux kernel version 1.1.59, with SCSI+IDE+NEC260 IDE CD support.
nec260:
nec260:   This is a Linux kernel with support for the NEC 260 CD-ROM as the
nec260:   second device on the IDE controller.  It also supports all the SCSI
nec260:   devices supported by the standard kernel.
